        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Since `get_name()` now includes the custom source name, I think it makes sense to show it with the tool/method right away instead of after using picker-specific actions (like the default picker does):\n\nI've thought about it, but I don't think this is the best choice. If the user has assigned the name, it should be shown as is at least first. The change of either search method or globs would then be useful to show in the name, as it is again the explicit user action. So the current behavior is intentional.",
